---
import { SiDiscord } from 'react-icons/si';

const playURL = 'https://allies.lithylabs.com';
const discordURL = 'https://discord.gg/SxTVMVbr5f';
const title = 'Allies: The Art of Betrayal';
const description = 'A Risk-inspired strategy game. Explore Prestige, challenge AI opponents, and discover whether rivals can work together to stop a runaway leader.';
const canonicalURL = new URL('/allies', 'https://lithylabs.com');
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonicalURL} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonicalURL} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="LithyLabs home">
          <img src="/lithylabs-icon.svg" width="30" height="30" alt="" />
          LithyLabs
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="LithyLabs navigation">
          <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="allies-title">
        <div class="hero-inner wrap">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">A strategy game in the making</p>
          <h1 id="allies-title"><span class="game-name">Allies<span class="sr-only">:</span></span><span class="subtitle">The Art of Betrayal</span></h1>
          <h2>Can you find the strategy that breaks Allies?</h2>
          <p>Allies is a Risk-inspired strategy game exploring a question: <strong>how do you get someone who wants to beat you to help you?</strong></p>
          <p>I’m building it with points that reward action and a resource called <strong>Prestige</strong> that changes how you build—and spend—your military strength. Now I need players to challenge my assumptions and discover what I’ve missed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-play">
          <img class="hero-avatar" src="/allies/star-navigator.png" width="256" height="256" alt="Star Navigator, an Allies character with silver curls and a blue-and-gold uniform." />
          <a class="button button-play" href={playURL}>Play Allies</a>
        </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="prestige section wrap" aria-labelledby="prestige-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <h2 id="prestige-title">How much power<br class="desktop-break" /> do you spend now?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="section-copy">
          <p>Exchange Prestige for troops, or hold onto it to boost how many troops you can gain. Spend heavily for a decisive push—but leave yourself too little, and you may struggle to fight back.</p>
          <p>The strongest army on the board isn’t always the greatest threat. An opponent with Prestige in reserve may have far more power than their territories suggest.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="concept-art">
          <a href="/allies/prestige.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Enlarge the Prestige illustration (opens in a new tab)">
            <img src="/allies/prestige.png" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" alt="Troops now. Power in reserve. An Opportunist with 25 troops and 25 Prestige can gain 25 recruits. A Warlord with 5 troops and 100 Prestige at a ×4 multiplier can gain 400 recruits, then drops to 0 Prestige and Opportunist ×1." />
          </a>
          <figcaption><a href="/allies/prestige.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Enlarge illustration <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="cooperation section wrap" aria-labelledby="cooperation-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <h2 id="cooperation-title">Can you get your rivals to help you?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="section-copy">
          <p>A growing lead can become a runaway advantage. Can you stop the leader alone? Can you give another player a reason to help? With limited communication, your moves and signals become part of the strategy.</p>
          <p>My bet is that these pressures will make cooperation matter, even between rivals. <strong>I need real games to find out whether that holds up.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <figure class="concept-art">
          <img src="/allies/rivals.png" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" alt="Two rival commanders consider targeting the same dominant opponent, whose red territories cover most of the board." />
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="practice" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
        <div class="section wrap">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
            <h2 id="practice-title">Find your strategy against AI</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="section-copy">
            <p>You don’t need to organize a multiplayer match to get started. Play locally against AI opponents at your own pace, explore Prestige, and experiment with different strategies.</p>
            <p>The AIs won’t respond to persuasion, but they give you room to learn the mechanics. When you find an approach that works, bring it to a human match.</p>
            <p class="challenge"><strong>Will it still work when your opponents see what you’re doing—and work together to stop you?</strong></p>
            <a class="button button-play" href={playURL}>Play Allies</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="community section wrap" aria-labelledby="community-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <h2 id="community-title">Help discover what works—and what breaks</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="section-copy">
          <p>I’m looking for people to try unexpected strategies, find dominant ones, and tell me where the game gets interesting or falls flat.</p>
          <p>We’re a small group arranging multiplayer matches through Discord. You don’t need to bring friends or commit to a weekly schedule. Join us, and we’ll find a time to play.</p>
          <p class="account-note">Online multiplayer requires an Allies account.</p>
          <a class="button button-discord" href={discordURL}><SiDiscord size={24} aria-hidden="true" /> Join Discord</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="wrap">
      <a href="/">A LithyLabs game</a>
      <span>Allies: The Art of Betrayal</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { background: #f9f6ef; color: #223c3c; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 5px; }
  :global(a:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #b06a10; outline-offset: 6px; }
  :global(img) { display: block; max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
  :global(h1), :global(h2), :global(p), :global(figure) { margin: 0; }
  .wrap { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .sr-only { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  .skip-link { position: absolute; left: 16px; top: -100px; z-index: 10; padding: 12px; background: white; color: #123f40; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 12px; }
  .site-header { background: #0c3033; border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff20; color: #f9f6ef; }
  .header-inner { width: min(1280px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin: auto; min-height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .brand img { background: #f9f6ef; border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 30px; font-size: 15px; }
  nav a { text-decoration: none; }
  nav a:hover { color: #f5c66c; }
  .hero { background: #0c3033; color: #f9f6ef; padding: 66px 0 0; }
  .hero-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 256px; align-items: center; gap: 56px; padding-bottom: 56px; }
  .hero-copy { min-width: 0; }
  .hero-play { width: 256px; max-width: 100%; justify-self: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .hero-avatar { width: 100%; }
  .hero-play .button-play { width: 100%; min-width: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-inline: 20px; }
  .eyebrow { color: #f1c777; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  h1 { font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; }
  .game-name { display: block; font-size: clamp(72px, 10vw, 126px); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .subtitle { display: block; color: #f1c777; font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 43px); margin-top: 10px; }
  .hero h2 { font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px); line-height: 1.3; margin: 34px 0 18px; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; }
  p + p { margin-top: 20px; }
  .hero p:not(.eyebrow) { color: #d4e0dd; }
  .hero strong { color: #fff8e8; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 36px; min-height: 52px; padding: 14px 25px; margin-top: 28px; background: #f1c777; color: #173438; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: background .15s; }
  .button:hover { background: #ffda96; }
  .button span { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1; }
  .button-play { min-height: 66px; min-width: 222px; padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 18px; background: #f2b737; color: #173438; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
  .button-play:hover { background: #ffca54; }
  .section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: 40px 78px; padding-block: 86px; }
  .section-number { display: block; color: #8b6226; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .1em; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .section-heading h2 { font: 400 clamp(30px, 3.5vw, 42px)/1.17 Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .section-copy p { color: #435553; }
  .section-copy strong { color: #153f40; }
  .concept-art { grid-column: 1 / -1; width: min(100%, 760px); justify-self: center; margin-top: 8px; }
  .concept-art img { border: 1px solid #b9a27a; width: 100%; }
  .concept-art > a { display: block; }
  .cooperation { border-top: 1px solid #c8cec3; }
  figcaption { text-align: right; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; }
  .practice { background: #143f41; color: #fff7e6; }
  .practice .section-number { color: #f1c777; }
  .practice p { color: #d4e0dd; }
  .practice strong { color: #fff7e6; }
  .challenge { border-left: 2px solid #f1c777; padding-left: 22px; }
  .account-note { font-size: 15px; }
  .button-discord { background: #5865f2; color: #fff; gap: 12px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .button-discord:hover { background: #4752c4; }
  footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #c8cec3; padding-block: 28px; color: #50615c; font-size: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .hero-play { width: 222px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .wrap, .header-inner { width: calc(100% - 40px); }
    .header-inner { min-height: 68px; }
    nav { gap: 20px; }
    .hero { padding-top: 44px; }
    .hero-inner { padding-bottom: 34px; }
    .hero h2 { margin-top: 28px; }
    .hero p:not(.eyebrow) { text-align: left; }
    p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; padding-block: 54px; }
    .section-number { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .desktop-break { display: none; }
    .concept-art { margin: 0; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .button { transition: none; } }
</style>
